{"words": [{"text": "تِلْكَ", "translation": "This"}, {"text": "أُمَّةٌۭ", "translation": "(was) a community"}, {"text": "قَدْ", "translation": "(which)"}, {"text": "خَلَتْ ۖ", "translation": "has passed away"}, {"text": "لَهَا", "translation": "for it"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "كَسَبَتْ", "translation": "it earned"}, {"text": "وَلَكُم", "translation": "and for you"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "كَسَبْتُمْ ۖ", "translation": "you have earned"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "تُسْـَٔلُونَ", "translation": "you will be asked"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "about what"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they used to"}, {"text": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "do"}], "sahih": "That was a nation which has passed on. It will have [the consequence of] what it earned, and you will have what you have earned. And you will not be asked about what they used to do."}